{
  "en/desk": "<main class=\"mx-auto max-w-[var(--content-narrow)] space-y-6 px-6 py-7 text-[var(--text)]\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-2)]\" data-testid=\"settings-intro\">Paste the key from your Toko Token account.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\" data-testid=\"runtime-status\">Status: reading this desk&#x27;s settings…</p></div><form class=\"space-y-3\" data-testid=\"settings-form\"><section class=\"space-y-4 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2\"><div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text)]\">Toko Token gateway</h2><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Paste your gateway API key for this desk. It never comes back after save.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\" data-testid=\"settings-gateway-status\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--text)] disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"settings-gateway-recheck\">Re-check</button></div></div><label class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-2)]\">Gateway API key<input class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface-2)]/50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[var(--text)] placeholder:text-[var(--text-3)] focus:border-[var(--accent)] focus:bg-[var(--surface)] focus:outline-none\" type=\"password\" autoComplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"From your gateway dashboard\" data-testid=\"openai-key\" value=\"\"/></label><div class=\"raise rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-4\" data-testid=\"usage-panel\"><p class=\"panel-label\">Usage</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-inkbase\" data-testid=\"usage-this-key\">This key: Paste a gateway key to see spend.</p><p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"text-sm text-accent-800 underline underline-offset-2\" data-testid=\"usage-open\" href=\"/usage\" data-discover=\"true\">Open Usage</a></p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"save-settings\">Save</button></div></section><p class=\"px-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\" data-testid=\"privacy-note\">Prompts leave this machine only over HTTPS to api.tokotokenai.com. Nultron does not log prompts. Keys and threads are encrypted on disk. Toko Token retention is the gateway&#x27;s policy.</p></form><section class=\"space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-5\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-2)]\" id=\"settings-locale-label\">Language</span><div class=\"ui-select ui-select-field-root\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ui-select-trigger ui-select-trigger-field\" data-testid=\"settings-locale\" data-value=\"en\" data-options=\"en,id\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Language: English\" aria-labelledby=\"settings-locale-label\"><span class=\"ui-select-value-wrap\"><span class=\"ui-select-value\">English</span></span><svg class=\"ui-select-chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Applies after you restart Nultron. Chat and job modes follow this language.</p></div></section><section class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-4\" data-testid=\"settings-guide\"><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 basis-56\"><h2 class=\"font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Guide</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">A one-minute walk through the rail, Virtual agents, Chat, the Knowledge Base and Settings.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-testid=\"settings-guide-replay\">Replay the guide</button></section><div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-5 py-3.5\" data-testid=\"settings-advanced\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer select-none text-sm font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Models &amp; storage</summary><div class=\"mt-2 space-y-4\"></div></details><section class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-4\" data-testid=\"settings-reset\"><div><h2 class=\"font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Start over</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Forget the gateway key on this machine, or delete everything and get the fresh-install experience back.</p></div><details class=\"space-y-3\" data-testid=\"settings-reset-danger\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Sign out and delete</summary><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text)]\">Sign out of the gateway</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-sm text-[var(--danger)] underline disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"settings-reset-key\">Sign out</button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Forgets the saved key on every desk and sends you back to the first-run screen. Threads, desks, knowledge, and files stay.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1 border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text)]\">Reset to a fresh install</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-sm text-[var(--danger)] underline disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"settings-reset-all\">Delete everything</button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Deletes every bit of local data and restarts Nultron on the first-run screen.</p></div></details></section></div></main>",
  "id/desk": "<main class=\"mx-auto max-w-[var(--content-narrow)] space-y-6 px-6 py-7 text-[var(--text)]\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text-2)]\" data-testid=\"settings-intro\">Tempel kunci dari akun Toko Token Anda.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\" data-testid=\"runtime-status\">Status: membaca pengaturan meja kerja ini…</p></div><form class=\"space-y-3\" data-testid=\"settings-form\"><section class=\"space-y-4 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2\"><div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text)]\">Gateway Toko Token</h2><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Tempelkan kunci API gateway untuk meja kerja ini. Kunci tidak akan ditampilkan lagi setelah disimpan.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\" data-testid=\"settings-gateway-status\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--text)] disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"settings-gateway-recheck\">Periksa ulang</button></div></div><label class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-2)]\">Kunci API gateway<input class=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface-2)]/50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[var(--text)] placeholder:text-[var(--text-3)] focus:border-[var(--accent)] focus:bg-[var(--surface)] focus:outline-none\" type=\"password\" autoComplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"Dari dasbor gateway Anda\" data-testid=\"openai-key\" value=\"\"/></label><div class=\"raise rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-4\" data-testid=\"usage-panel\"><p class=\"panel-label\">Pemakaian</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-inkbase\" data-testid=\"usage-this-key\">Kunci ini: Tempelkan kunci gateway untuk melihat pengeluaran.</p><p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"text-sm text-accent-800 underline underline-offset-2\" data-testid=\"usage-open\" href=\"/usage\" data-discover=\"true\">Buka Pemakaian</a></p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"save-settings\">Simpan</button></div></section><p class=\"px-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\" data-testid=\"privacy-note\">Prompt hanya keluar dari komputer ini lewat HTTPS ke api.tokotokenai.com. Nultron tidak mencatat prompt. Kunci dan obrolan Anda dienkripsi di disk. Berapa lama data disimpan di Toko Token mengikuti kebijakan gateway.</p></form><section class=\"space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-5\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><span class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-2)]\" id=\"settings-locale-label\">Bahasa</span><div class=\"ui-select ui-select-field-root\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ui-select-trigger ui-select-trigger-field\" data-testid=\"settings-locale\" data-value=\"en\" data-options=\"en,id\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Bahasa: English\" aria-labelledby=\"settings-locale-label\"><span class=\"ui-select-value-wrap\"><span class=\"ui-select-value\">English</span></span><svg class=\"ui-select-chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Berlaku setelah Anda memulai ulang Nultron. Chat dan mode kerja mengikuti bahasa ini.</p></div></section><section class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-4\" data-testid=\"settings-guide\"><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 basis-56\"><h2 class=\"font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Panduan</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Tur satu menit untuk mengenal navigasi, Agen virtual, Chat, Knowledge Base, dan Pengaturan.</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-testid=\"settings-guide-replay\">Putar ulang panduan</button></section><div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-5 py-3.5\" data-testid=\"settings-advanced\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer select-none text-sm font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Model &amp; penyimpanan</summary><div class=\"mt-2 space-y-4\"></div></details><section class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 rounded-xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] p-4\" data-testid=\"settings-reset\"><div><h2 class=\"font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Mulai dari awal</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Hapus kunci gateway dari komputer ini, atau hapus semua data dan kembalikan aplikasi ke kondisi seperti baru dipasang.</p></div><details class=\"space-y-3\" data-testid=\"settings-reset-danger\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-[var(--text)]\">Keluar dan hapus</summary><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text)]\">Keluar dari gateway</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-sm text-[var(--danger)] underline disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"settings-reset-key\">Keluar</button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Menghapus kunci tersimpan di semua meja kerja dan mengembalikan Anda ke layar setup awal. Obrolan, meja kerja, pengetahuan, dan file tetap ada.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1 border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--text)]\">Setel ulang seperti instalasi baru</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-sm text-[var(--danger)] underline disabled:opacity-50\" data-testid=\"settings-reset-all\">Hapus semuanya</button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-3)]\">Menghapus semua data lokal dan memulai ulang Nultron dari layar setup awal.</p></div></details></section></div></main>"
}
